# ─── Floating support button → ResolveDesk customer portal ───────────────────
# URL the bottom-right "Support" button links to (opens in the same tab).
#
# Dev: leave unset — the app falls back to http://localhost:5174 automatically.
# Prod: set this to the deployed customer-portal URL, then rebuild + redeploy
#       (Vite inlines env vars at build time). If left unset in a production
#       build, the button hides itself rather than pointing users at localhost.
#
# Candidate prod URLs (confirm which host is actually live before using):
#   https://resolvedesk-customer.vercel.app
#   https://resolvedesk-customer.onrender.com
#
# VITE_CUSTOMER_PORTAL_URL=
